  q_account:[['How do I sign in to Wakhan?','With Google, Facebook or e-mail. If you signed up before, use the same method so your account, friends and coins stay with you.'],['I did not get the e-mail code.','Check your spam folder and wait a few minutes. Then tap “Resend code” on the same screen.'],['How do I change my username?','In Me › Edit profile. You can change your username once every 14 days.'],['How do I delete my account?','In Me › Settings › Delete account. Deleting your account also removes your coins, subscriptions and items for good.']],
